msgid "Raw Ethernet MAC, MDIO and DP83848"
msgstr "Raw Ethernet MAC、MDIO 与 DP83848"

msgid ""
"This optional mechanism keeps network protocols, tasks, MAC-address policy, "
"negotiation policy, PHY power/reset circuitry and product recovery outside "
"Nexus. Lookup returns immutable Ethernet and MDIO faces; it never starts "
"hardware. The default platform does not instantiate descriptors, buffers, a "
"PHY or a worker."
msgstr ""
"此可选机制将网络协议、任务、MAC 地址策略、协商策略、PHY 电源／复位电路与产品恢复留在 Nexus 外部。查找返回不可变 "
"Ethernet／MDIO 接口面，绝不启动硬件。默认平台不实例化描述符、缓冲区、PHY 或 worker。"

msgid ""
"The first mode is RMII, normal four-word chained descriptors, contiguous "
"untagged Ethernet II frames, 14–1514 bytes excluding FCS. Length-coded IEEE "
"802.3, 802.1Q/802.1ad tags, jumbo frames, checksum offload, PTP and "
"scatter/gather are rejected or remain separate unsupported modes. TX padding"
" and FCS insertion stay in hardware. RX storage has at least 1518 bytes; "
"automatic CRC/pad/type stripping is disabled, so the reported RX descriptor "
"length includes its four-byte FCS. The public loan subtracts exactly four "
"bytes after complete-frame bounds checks. No software claim establishes "
"cable, waveform or throughput qualification."
msgstr ""
"首模式是 RMII、普通四字 chained 描述符和连续无标签 Ethernet II 帧，不含 FCS 的长度为 14–1514 字节。长度编码 "
"IEEE 802.3、802.1Q/802.1ad 标签、jumbo、checksum offload、PTP 和 scatter/gather "
"被拒绝或属于独立不支持模式。TX padding／FCS 插入由硬件执行。RX 存储至少 1518 字节；自动 CRC/pad/type 剥离关闭，所以"
" RX 描述符长度含四字节 FCS。公共借用在完整帧边界校验后精确减去四字节。软件声明不能建立线缆、波形或吞吐资格。"

msgid "Static storage and data ownership"
msgstr "静态存储与数据所有权"

msgid ""
"Caller assembly supplies exact TX/RX descriptor arrays, TX slots, RX "
"metadata and buffers. No SDK default five-buffer pool or global cursor is "
"linked. The provider validates aligned descriptors, complete Ethernet-bus-"
"master read/write spans, array/control/payload separation and independent "
"buffers before DMA reset or OWN publication. TX payloads need four-byte "
"alignment and may not overlap a request, any provider/control/descriptor/RX "
"storage or another borrowed request. Read-only TX payload sharing is allowed"
" while every corresponding borrow lives. Current STM32/GD32 bindings accept "
"their reviewed main SRAM only: respectively 128/192 KiB at 0x20000000. STM "
"CCM and GD TCM are excluded; GD additional SRAM is not yet admitted by this "
"Ethernet binding. CPU reachability or a SPI DMA selector does not establish "
"Ethernet reachability."
msgstr ""
"调用方装配提供精确 TX/RX 描述符数组、TX 槽、RX 元数据和缓冲区，不链接 SDK 默认五缓冲池或全局 cursor。提供者在 DMA "
"reset 或 OWN 发布前校验对齐描述符、完整 Ethernet 总线主读写范围、数组／控制／payload 分离及缓冲区独立性。TX "
"payload 需四字节对齐，不得与请求、提供者／控制／描述符／RX 存储或其他借用请求重叠；只读 TX payload 可共享，但各借用均须存活。当前"
" STM32/GD32 绑定只接纳已审主 SRAM，即 0x20000000 起的 128/192 KiB；排除 STM CCM 和 GD TCM，GD"
" 额外 SRAM 尚未接纳。CPU 可达性或 SPI DMA 选择器不能建立 Ethernet 可达性。"

msgid ""
"A TX request is borrowed only after all validation and atomic admission. "
"Buffer, length and chained pointer are written before DMB and OWN. Normal "
"completion requires a CPU-owned last/first single-frame descriptor with its "
"DMA-written TX status. Both manuals state the last descriptor receives MAC "
"transmit status before ownership returns. The buffer/control reference is "
"cleared, DSB executes, the provider slot is detached and only then SETTLED "
"is release-published. Success reports the submitted bytes transmitted by the"
" MAC, not delivery to a peer application. Returned error status reports IO; "
"no request is retried."
msgstr ""
"TX 请求在全部校验和原子准入后才借用。Buffer、length、chained pointer 在 DMB 与 OWN 前写入。正常完成要求单帧 "
"first/last 描述符归 CPU 所有且具有 DMA 写回 TX 状态。两家手册均规定最后描述符在归还所有权前接收 MAC "
"发送状态。先清缓冲／控制引用，再 DSB，再解除提供者槽，最后 release 发布 SETTLED。成功表示提交字节被 MAC "
"发出，不代表交付到对端应用。错误状态报 IO，无请求重试。"

msgid ""
"Each RX descriptor has DMA, READY or HELD metadata and a monotonically "
"increasing 64-bit incarnation. One complete descriptor is published only "
"after OWN returned and an acquire barrier. READY slots form a caller-"
"metadata FIFO: enqueue, acquire and matching release are constant-time and "
"never scan a variable ring under the mask. A held descriptor remains CPU-"
"owned at ring wrap. No copy pool or overwrite can satisfy backpressure. CRC,"
" length, fragmented, tagged/unsupported and other DMA error frames are "
"discarded with latched flags and saturating discard counts. RBU/overflow "
"observations are visible separately; they do not invent an exact lost-frame "
"count. A stale, foreign or double token cannot rearm a buffer. Epochs "
"survive a successful stop/restart; exhaustion closes admission rather than "
"wraps."
msgstr ""
"每个 RX 描述符有 DMA、READY、HELD 元数据与单调 64 位 incarnation。OWN 返回并执行 acquire "
"屏障后才发布完整描述符。READY 槽组成调用方元数据 FIFO，enqueue、acquire 和匹配 release "
"为常数时间，不在掩码内扫描变长环。借出的描述符在环回绕时仍归 CPU。复制池或覆盖不能替代背压。CRC、长度、分片、标签／不支持及其他 DMA "
"错误帧丢弃并锁存标志和饱和丢弃计数；RBU／overflow 另行观察，不虚构精确丢帧数。旧、外来或重复 token 不能重新装填缓冲。Epoch "
"跨成功 stop/restart 保留，耗尽关闭准入而非回绕。"

msgid "IRQ, cancellation and stop"
msgstr "IRQ、取消与停止"

msgid ""
"The ISR processes at most one TX and one RX descriptor. Coalesced "
"completions repend the selected actual vector when another CPU-owned "
"completed descriptor is ready. Hardware and descriptor accesses are direct "
"volatile loads/stores on the MCU, with no per-register operations table. "
"Optional cold callbacks handle NVIC source control, repending and current-"
"priority validation, rather than payload bytes. The wake is a bounded IRQ-"
"only hint; task service does not invoke it. Its actual current "
"priority/group must satisfy the configured kernel ceiling. A captured wake "
"stays borrowed until its callback returns. Attach/stop reports BUSY while a "
"publisher exists; a callback cannot release its own live context."
msgstr ""
"ISR 最多处理一个 TX 和一个 RX 描述符。如果另一个 CPU-owned 已完成描述符可用，合并完成会重新 pending 所选实际向量。MCU"
" 硬件及描述符直接 volatile 读写，无逐寄存器方法表。可选冷态回调处理 NVIC 源控制、重新 pending 与当前优先级校验，不处理 "
"payload 字节。Wake 是有界仅 IRQ 提示，任务 service 不调用它；实际当前 priority/group 必须满足配置内核 "
"ceiling。已捕获 wake 在回调返回前保持借用。存在发布者时 attach/stop 返回 BUSY；回调不能释放自身活动 context。"

msgid ""
"One serialized privileged task owns control methods, with incoming masks "
"clear. Metadata guards save/restore the incoming PRIMASK. No task, RTOS lock"
" or worker is created. Consumers process their loan outside those short "
"guards. Cold storage validation can scale with descriptor count; it runs "
"before hardware acquisition."
msgstr ""
"唯一串行特权任务持有控制方法，进入掩码全清。元数据 guard 保存／恢复进入 PRIMASK，不建立任务、RTOS 锁或 worker。消费者在短 "
"guard 外处理借用。冷态存储校验可随描述符数量增长，但运行在硬件取得之前。"

msgid ""
"Cancellation closes the shared TX engine and is explicitly controller-wide. "
"Other pending TX requests are cancelled too; an already returned successful "
"wire status remains success. Changing speed/duplex requires the external "
"owner to apply link-down first, then observe both DMA processes and MAC/FIFO"
" state idle before applying the new up fact. Until then BUSY preserves the "
"old mode; an unchanged up fact is idempotent. Restarting drained TX in the "
"same mode does not require discarding live RX. This follows the independent "
"process and MAC enable semantics in RM0090 §33.6.1/§33.8 and GD32F4xx manual"
" §27.3.3/§27.4.1. Link-down and fatal DMA/underflow errors close admission "
"and report IO without replay. Task service advances absolute request and "
"drain deadlines. Cancel/timeout alone never revoke request or payload "
"ownership."
msgstr ""
"取消关闭共享 TX 引擎，明确影响整个控制器；其他 pending TX 也取消，已经返回的成功线侧状态保留成功。改变 speed/duplex "
"时，外部所有者先应用 link-down，再观察两个 DMA 进程及 MAC/FIFO 空闲，然后应用新 up 事实。此前 BUSY 保留旧模式；相同 "
"up 事实幂等。同模式重启已排空 TX 不要求丢弃活动 RX，遵循 RM0090 §33.6.1/§33.8 和 GD32F4xx 手册 "
"§27.3.3/§27.4.1 的独立进程及 MAC enable 语义。Link-down、致命 DMA／underflow 错误关闭准入并报 "
"IO，不重放。任务 service 推进绝对请求和排空 deadline。Cancel／timeout 自身从不撤销请求或 payload 所有权。"

msgid ""
"Withdrawal clears DMA ST and MAC TE, reads their actual state, requires TX "
"process state stopped, issues TX FIFO flush and observes its self-clearing "
"acknowledgement and inactive MAC/FIFO state. Only then may software withdraw"
" an unexecuted OWN bit; the descriptor is read back before references "
"detach. A refused OWN, running engine or stuck FIFO flush retains "
"QUARANTINED requests when drain expires. Later actual quiescence may settle "
"them, but cannot invent a successful transfer."
msgstr ""
"撤销清除 DMA ST 与 MAC TE，读取真实状态，要求 TX process 停止，发出 TX FIFO flush 并观察自清确认及 "
"MAC/FIFO 非活动。然后才可软件撤销未执行 OWN，并在解除引用前读回描述符。OWN 拒绝、引擎仍运行或 FIFO flush "
"卡住时，排空超时保留 QUARANTINED 请求。后续真实静止可完成并排空它们，但不能虚构成功传输。"

msgid ""
"Stop additionally closes RX/MAC/DMA admission and sources, requires RX "
"process state stopped and no active MAC receive path, checks MDIO/reset idle"
" and DMA interrupt-disable readback, detaches and clears the selected NVIC "
"source, then withdraws RX OWN with readback. It clears descriptor base "
"pointers and W1C status and checks those writes before releasing "
"wake/storage ownership. Held consumer loans prevent successful stop and "
"remain immutable. Callers join all task/IRQ publishers and consumers before "
"reclaiming assembly storage or Board clocks/pins. Partial startup owns its "
"residual effects and must use this same explicit stop; a reset/IRQ-enable "
"failure is never replaced with successful cleanup fiction."
msgstr ""
"Stop 额外关闭 RX/MAC/DMA 准入和源，要求 RX process 停止、MAC 接收路径无活动，检查 MDIO/reset idle 和 "
"DMA interrupt-disable 读回，detach 并清除所选 NVIC 源，再撤销且读回 RX OWN。解除 wake／storage "
"所有权前清描述符基址与 W1C 状态并校验写入。Consumer 持有的借用禁止 stop 成功且保持不可变。回收装配存储或 Board "
"时钟／引脚前，调用者 join 全部 task／IRQ 发布者与消费者。部分启动持有残余效果，必须使用同一显式 stop；reset／IRQ-"
"enable 失败绝不替换为虚构清理成功。"

msgid "Station management and PHY facts"
msgstr "站点管理与 PHY 事实"

msgid ""
"Clause22 MDIO is a narrow, separate face using the same explicitly owned MAC"
" clock. Addresses/registers are 0..31. Operations run only in privileged "
"task context with masks clear, never wait in IRQ/PRIMASK and require a "
"finite absolute monotonic deadline. The divider comes from actual HCLK: the "
"two supported bindings use 168/200 MHz and HCLK/102, below 2.5 MHz. BUSY "
"rejects without another command. Timeout leaves the real hardware state "
"intact and does not publish a late read value; a timed-out write may already"
" have applied and must not be blindly replayed."
msgstr ""
"Clause22 MDIO 是独立窄接口面，使用同一显式持有的 MAC 时钟，地址／寄存器范围 0..31。操作仅限特权任务、掩码全清，绝不在 "
"IRQ／PRIMASK 等待，且要求有限绝对单调 deadline。分频来自实际 HCLK；两组支持绑定使用 168/200 MHz 和 "
"HCLK/102，低于 2.5 MHz。BUSY 拒绝且不发另一个命令。超时保留真实硬件状态，不发布迟到读值；超时写可能已生效，不能盲目重放。"

msgid ""
"DP83848 state contains an explicit address and expected model ID. TI "
"0x20005ca0 and NS 0x20005c90 variants are selected explicitly; only the "
"revision nibble is ignored. No unknown ID falls back to a supported PHY. "
"BMCR soft reset observes the actual self-clearing bit under the same "
"deadline and invalidates configured truth. It restraps the PHY but proves "
"neither GPIO/power reset nor fitted straps. Products select either explicit "
"10/100 half/full advertisement or fixed speed and duplex. Configuration "
"success starts negotiation; it does not assert link. Observation reads "
"latch-low BMSR twice plus PHYSTS and reports link only after valid link and,"
" when selected, complete negotiation. Remote fault, loopback/reset or "
"inconsistent fixed mode is not converted to successful link."
msgstr ""
"DP83848 状态包含显式地址和预期型号 ID，显式选择 TI 0x20005ca0 或 NS 0x20005c90，只忽略 revision "
"nibble。未知 ID 不回退为支持 PHY。BMCR 软复位在同一 deadline 下观察实际自清位并作废已配置事实；它重新读取 "
"straps，但不证明 GPIO／电源 reset 或已装 straps。产品选择显式 10/100 半／全双工广告或固定 "
"speed/duplex。配置成功启动协商，不宣称 link。观察两次读取 latch-low BMSR 加 PHYSTS；只有有效 link "
"且所选协商完成才报告 link。Remote fault、loopback/reset 或固定模式不一致不转换为 link 成功。"

msgid "Reviewed sources and qualification limits"
msgstr "已审来源与资格限制"

msgid ""
"Production layout/mask assertions use the locked STM CMSIS device and GD32 "
"standard peripheral headers. Mechanism review uses ST RM0090 Rev22, Ethernet"
" normal descriptors, TxDMA default flow, DMA process-state/FIFO controls; "
"GD32F4xx User Manual Rev3.3 chapter27, normal descriptors and station-"
"management clock range. Both first four descriptor words and all registers "
"used by the common mechanism match these proofs; enhanced descriptor/PTP "
"mode remains disabled."
msgstr ""
"生产布局／mask 断言使用锁定 STM CMSIS device 和 GD32 标准外设头文件。机制审查来源为 ST RM0090 Rev22 的 "
"Ethernet 普通描述符、TxDMA 默认流和 DMA process-state／FIFO 控制，以及 GD32F4xx User Manual "
"Rev3.3 第 27 章普通描述符与管理时钟范围。前四个描述符字及公共机制全部寄存器符合这些证明；enhanced descriptor／PTP "
"保持关闭。"

msgid ""
"DP83848 register truth comes from TI SNLS266E (March2015), "
"Tables6-9/10/11/12/13/18 and https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/dp83848c.pdf."
" The documented TI model/revision is 0x20005ca2. The explicit TI and NS ID "
"distinction is independently confirmed by Linux v6.12 "
"drivers/net/phy/dp83848.c; that GPL source is review evidence only and is "
"not linked or copied into the production component."
msgstr ""
"DP83848 寄存器事实来自 TI SNLS266E（March2015）表 6-9/10/11/12/13/18 和 "
"https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/dp83848c.pdf。文档中 TI 型号／revision 是 "
"0x20005ca2。Linux v6.12 drivers/net/phy/dp83848.c 独立确认 TI 与 NS ID 区别；该 GPL "
"源仅用于审阅证据，不链接或复制到生产组件。"

msgid ""
"The Qiming F407ZG optional RMII source profile is reviewed separately: "
"manual printed31/physical33 and fixed BSP blob "
"a35e981e8a549e1dbaf84bb4522b2f150bc5d51c show DP83848 address1, an external "
"50 MHz oscillator and P5/WiFi jumpers; pins PA1/2/7, PC1/4/5, PG11/13/14 "
"AF11. PG routes do not authorize the VE100 package. PHY reset GPIO is "
"unproved. Sky and Liangshan have no reviewed PHY route. Current Board "
"bindings must stay disabled until configuration integration admits an "
"explicit reviewed route; model code is not a fabricated PCB binding."
msgstr ""
"启明 F407ZG 可选 RMII 源配置另行审阅：手册 printed31/physical33 和固定 BSP blob "
"a35e981e8a549e1dbaf84bb4522b2f150bc5d51c 给出 DP83848 address1、外部 50 MHz 晶振和 "
"P5/WiFi 跳帽，引脚 PA1/2/7、PC1/4/5、PG11/13/14 AF11。PG 路由不能授权 VE100 封装。PHY reset "
"GPIO 未证明。天空星和梁山派没有已审 PHY 路由。配置集成接纳显式已审路由前，当前 Board 绑定必须禁用；模型代码不能虚构 PCB 绑定。"

msgid ""
"GoogleTest/GoogleMock tests execute the actual common algorithm, both SDK-"
"checked bindings and explicit Native ingress/egress/MDIO hardware, including"
" W1C and stuck reset/engine/OWN/FIFO/IRQ sources. Native hardware uses "
"caller PHY register files, synthetic FCS storage and explicit descriptor-"
"completion injection; it never invents PHY identity, link, real CRC or "
"remote delivery. Host software, strict ARM compilation, linked image "
"resources and physical/HIL are separate evidence. The first three establish "
"only their recorded scope. Physical PHY/link/electrical, actual PCB jumpers,"
" loss under traffic, latency, throughput and EMC are not executed in this "
"environment."
msgstr ""
"GoogleTest/GoogleMock 执行真实公共算法、两家 SDK 校验绑定及显式 Native ingress/egress/MDIO "
"硬件，包括 W1C 和卡住 reset／engine／OWN／FIFO／IRQ 源。Native 硬件使用调用方 PHY 寄存器文件、合成 FCS "
"存储和显式描述符完成注入，不虚构 PHY identity、link、真实 CRC 或远端交付。主机软件、严格 ARM 编译、链接镜像资源和物理／HIL"
" 是独立证据，前三项只建立记录范围。本环境未执行物理 PHY/link/电气、PCB 跳帽、流量丢失、延迟、吞吐或 EMC。"

msgid ""
"Independent review regressions protect the known immutable wake-target span "
"against descriptors, RX DMA buffers, request metadata and writable API "
"outputs. Opaque callback-context size remains an external lifetime contract."
" Wake replacement rechecks in-flight publishers under the same exclusion as "
"replacing the pointer. Stop rechecks publishers after actual NVIC withdrawal"
" and closes IRQ dispatch before unmasked ring/table cleanup; failed cleanup "
"retains the controller. Closing rejects new RX acquire; existing held loans "
"still release."
msgstr ""
"独立审查回归保护已知不可变 wake-target 范围，防止它与描述符、RX DMA 缓冲、请求元数据及可写 API 输出重叠。不透明 "
"callback-context 大小仍由外部生命周期合同负责。Wake 替换在更换指针的同一排他下复核活动发布者。Stop 在真实 NVIC "
"撤销后再检查发布者，并在未屏蔽的 ring/table 清理前关闭 IRQ dispatch；清理失败保留控制器。Closing 拒绝新 RX "
"acquire，但既有借出块仍可 release。"
